TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":1525206578,"text":"どうした、何か確認したいことでもあるのか？","nextNodeIds":[750420103,750420108,750420115]},{"nodeId":750420103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1391661442,"text":"「焔の主の祝福」について…","nextNodeIds":[750420104]},{"nodeId":750420104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":4126620874,"text":"「焔の主の祝福」…これは先祖返りの一種だと考える者がいる。なぜならその力には、血筋に由来する根源的なものがあると考えられているからだ。","nextNodeIds":[750420105]},{"nodeId":750420105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":489317586,"text":"ただ…龍の遺物研究会の記録によれば、「焔の主の祝福」の印が付いてる仔竜のほとんどが、成長する過程で、体内の制御不能な力に影響されてしまう…","nextNodeIds":[750420106]},{"nodeId":750420106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":1136108842,"text":"力が体の中で暴れまわるせいで、暴走したり、理性を失ったりして、普通の竜とは別のものになってしまうんだ…","nextNodeIds":[750420107]},{"nodeId":750420107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":2173454010,"text":"クク竜の暴君「ホラワイガ」がいい例だ…ホラワイガは「焔の主の祝福」を受けていたと言われている。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":750420108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2048711602,"text":"部族での「処分」について…","nextNodeIds":[750420109]},{"nodeId":750420109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":1648032962,"text":"つまり、あいつを夜神の国に帰すということだ。あいつは生まれてからずっと、龍や夜神の国に拒まれ続けていたかもしれないが…","nextNodeIds":[750420110]},{"nodeId":750420110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":3189677690,"text":"この世を離れたら、夜に帰らなくてはならない。あいつにとっては冷たい事実だが、夜の国であいつは他の魂と共存できる…","nextNodeIds":[750420111]},{"nodeId":750420111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":1218133866,"text":"勝手だと思われるかもしれないが…それもある種の優しさだと思っている。","nextNodeIds":[750420112]},{"nodeId":750420112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1632428250,"text":"象徴物の手がかりはあるの？","nextNodeIds":[750420113]},{"nodeId":750420113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":3712507970,"text":"あるにはあるが…確かめてみないと。次に俺を訪ねるときは、パカル——こだまの子の族長のところまで来てくれ。","nextNodeIds":[750420114]},{"nodeId":750420114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":1795288474,"text":"見た目は少し…派手だが…最も固い晶石よりも頼もしい人物だと保証する。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":750420115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3295635642,"text":"もう聞きたいことはないから、またね！","nextNodeIds":[750420116]},{"nodeId":750420116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","textMapHash":1050971586,"text":"友よ、またいつでも来てくれ。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7501901,3],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7504201],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21481,"speakerName":"マンク","count":12},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":4}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":1625146870,"CHECNJEMEFE":{},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_NONE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":true,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLA